(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-54","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["早晨联络员想[[intervene|干预]]接送，大学[[undergraduate|本科生]]志愿者却把确认卡给医护。孩子给车贴蓝[[symbol|标志]]，只是认车，不代表基金认证。接收床位仍[[available|可用]]，[[luggage|行李]]按家属名单装好。一个孩子想[[lick|舔]]糖纸，护士递来干净水；另一人叫自己的纸火箭[[missile|导弹]]，程雾让他收进袋别扔窗外。车队的[[dynamic|动态的]]位置要实时传给接收点，安排未必尽都[[satisfactory|令人满意]]，至少每个人知道去哪、谁陪同、可以拨哪个电话。我们不靠孩子笑了便认定计划完善，只在他们看不见的小表上继续补能减少麻烦的细节。","一张改签可能[[generate|引起]]新误会，医生把[[unusual|不平常的]]来路说明留自己处，不给家属[[extreme|极度的]]压力。程雾卷好电线[[coil|线圈]]，要[[ensure|保证]]备用灯可用。取样登记的[[organism|生物]]栏仍待检验，不能[[suppose|假定]]都有结论。[[remarkable|值得注意的]]是司机主动试[[brake|刹车]]，而非催孩子上车。旧[[tube|管]]留在隔离库，会计[[accountancy|工作]]也留下暂停收货项。老陈从侧面看车轮，确认地面垫稳后才向程雾点头；每个人能做到的事都有限，却都应在自己的那一步上清楚些，不要用另一个人的保证越过。","我们站在大厅[[carpet|地毯]]边，白塔章只是[[hint|线索]]，册页能[[demonstrate|说明]]样品去过的转送[[region|地区]]，不等于原材料表。基金[[yearly|每年的]]援助还会来，护士用[[saucer|碟子]]收遗落药袋，照家属清单归还。车是[[hire|租用]]的，山口过去靠[[donkey|驴]]驮物，如今[[destination|目的地]]能在车上核。登记纸上的[[vertical|竖式的]]编号两列并行，杜医生一列记人，一列记样品，不让相同日期把两种接收合成同一件事。何警官在电话里说会继续查配货线，暂时分开不会让三个人或任何一页材料没人接着。","我过去把[[learning|学习]]当越记越多，如今要学不越界。修船铺[[monument|纪念物]]式的旧照片并不替我们推理，那是个[[misconception|误解]]。孩子的画很[[vivid|生动]]，记录里却有[[gap|缺口]]，[[missing|缺掉的]]最初批次仍在别处。医生[[emphasize|强调]]善意是[[virtue|美德]]，不能当证书。病人继续[[normal|正常的]]照料，书架上父亲留下的书让我停了一下；医生说父亲是一位[[socialist|社会主义者]]，常提醒他把服务写成实事。我不需要同意每个理念才尊重他今天的选择，他也不拿父亲的身份免掉自己那几次没有追到原报告的责任。","[[previous|以前的]]样品由展务人员顺带[[transmit|传送]]，杜医生夹着那本谈[[socialism|社会主义]]的旧书，说父亲期待人人能得到照料，期待必须靠记录和工作兑现。[[technology|技术]]的帮助不该[[weaken|削弱]]追问。灯电源[[voltage|电压]]已核，接收[[superior|上级]]给护士明确床位，不只泛说等人来。安全点[[location|位置]]写在卡背，一位捐助人就算[[bankrupt|破产的]]也不能成为供水突然消失的理由。约好的司机[[punctual|准时的]]到门口，程雾替孩子扣好安全带，医护再核一轮名单。出发前她没对我们许诺回来就万事结束，只说安置好会先发消息。","车开时程雾临时离开诊所，陪同医护护送六个病孩去安全接收点；她还没抵达，归队也未发生。我和老陈留在杜医生办公室，签收盖白塔章的实验登记册，拍下封面与逐页编号。我们尚未取得海岛原始批次表，这本只是诊所的观察、取样与移交记录，不能代替它。杜医生圈出下一站山城配货站，我与老陈约定第二天先去那里确认样品和货物的出港路线。窗外车声渐远，老陈把一杯热水推给我，程雾留下的空椅还在。三个人暂时分开，纸页没有因此被分成互不相干的故事。"],"en":["A liaison tried to [[intervene|intervene]], but an [[undergraduate|undergraduate]] volunteer gave cards to clinicians. A blue [[symbol|symbol]] identified the car, not certification. Beds stayed [[available|available]], [[luggage|luggage]] matched families. A child would [[lick|lick]] candy paper; a nurse provided clean water. Another called a paper rocket a [[missile|missile]]; Cheng stowed it safely. [[dynamic|Dynamic]] positions went to reception. Not wholly [[satisfactory|satisfactory]], the plan still named destinations, escorts and contacts. Children's smiles did not replace our private checks.","Changes could [[generate|generate]] misunderstandings. Du retained [[unusual|unusual]] source details without imposing [[extreme|extreme]] pressure. Cheng packed a wire [[coil|coil]] to [[ensure|ensure]] light. An [[organism|organism]] field awaited tests; we could not [[suppose|suppose]] results. The [[remarkable|remarkable]] act was the driver testing a [[brake|brake]] before boarding. Old [[tube|tubes]] stayed isolated, [[accountancy|accountancy]] recorded paused receipts. Chen checked stable wheels before nodding. Everyone had limited tasks, none could skip their own step through another's assurance.","Beside a [[carpet|carpet]], we treated the stamp as a [[hint|hint]]. Pages could [[demonstrate|demonstrate]] transfer [[region|regions]], not original materials. [[yearly|Yearly]] aid continued; a nurse collected lost packets on a [[saucer|saucer]] according to lists. A [[hire|hire]] vehicle replaced routes once served by [[donkey|donkey]]. Its [[destination|destination]] was confirmed. [[vertical|Vertical]] columns separated people and samples sharing dates. He would trace freight; temporary separation left neither team members nor paper without continuing care.","[[learning|Learning]] now meant respecting limits. Workshop photographs as a [[monument|monument]] could not reason for us: that was a [[misconception|misconception]]. [[vivid|Vivid]] drawings accompanied a documentary [[gap|gap]] and [[missing|missing]] original batches. Du would [[emphasize|emphasize]] that [[virtue|virtue]] was no certificate. [[normal|Normal]] care continued. His father's books drew my gaze. A [[socialist|socialist]], his father urged concrete service. Respecting today's choice required no agreement with every ideal, nor did family beliefs excuse Du's failure to pursue original reports.","Exhibit staff once helped [[transmit|transmit]] [[previous|previous]] samples. Holding a book on [[socialism|socialism]], Du said equal care required records and work. [[technology|Technology]] must not [[weaken|weaken]] questions. Checked [[voltage|voltage]] and a receiving [[superior|superior]]'s assigned beds provided specifics. The safe [[location|location]] appeared on cards. Even a [[bankrupt|bankrupt]] donor could not justify vanished water. A [[punctual|punctual]] driver arrived; Cheng secured belts while nurses checked names. She promised a message after placement, not instant resolution upon return.","Cheng temporarily left the clinic with clinicians to escort six sick children to safe reception. She had not arrived or rejoined us. Chen and I signed for Du's White Tower-stamped experimental register, photographing numbered pages. We had not obtained the island's original batch table; this held clinic observations, sampling and handovers, no substitute. Du circled the mountain distribution station. Chen and I agreed to go there tomorrow first to confirm outgoing routes for samples and goods. The vehicle faded; Chen pushed me hot water beside Cheng's empty chair. Separation did not divide the pages into unrelated stories."]});
